  "goodToKnow": "Der Schwarzmarkt is a black market: auf dem Schwarzmarkt kaufen. In post-war Germany (1945–48), before the currency reform, cigarettes served as the main black-market currency. Schwarz often means illegal or undeclared: Schwarzarbeit (undeclared work), schwarzfahren (to ride without a ticket), Schwarzgeld (undeclared money). Plural: die Schwarzmärkte."
